WEBVTT

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:16.240
It's cold!

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:22.330
But that's why I love it.

00:00:32.610 --> 00:00:37.910
It doesn't matter when

00:00:32.610 --> 00:00:37.910
itsudemo donna toki mo

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:43.340
I always think of your smile

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:43.340
omoidasu no wa kimi no egao de

00:00:43.470 --> 00:00:48.810
The single word that I couldn't say

00:00:43.470 --> 00:00:48.810
mada sono tada hitokoto

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:54.010
I've always wanted to say it to you

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:54.010
kimi ni mo tsutae dainda zutto

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:57.490
I pray so that our hearts may be connected

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:57.490
ima wa fureoi inotteta

00:00:57.350 --> 00:01:00.230
But I couldn't see through the clouds

00:00:57.350 --> 00:01:00.230
kumo wo tsuuka mienai

00:01:00.070 --> 00:01:04.980
In front of you, I swear that

00:01:00.070 --> 00:01:04.980
mae ni chikatta toshitemo

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:07.840
I will always be your side

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:07.840
koko ni iru yo

00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:14.720
The future we anticipate is still far away

00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:14.720
bokura no mezasu mirai wa mada mada tooku

00:01:14.680 --> 00:01:18.280
You say that it's at the end of the world

00:01:14.680 --> 00:01:18.280
hateshi naitteto

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:23.950
As long as I have a reason to shed tears

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:23.950
namida no sonowake ga aru kagiri

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:28.810
I will not stop moving towards it

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:28.810
massugu aruite yukou

00:01:28.610 --> 00:01:38.740
As usual, we'll be together today

00:01:28.610 --> 00:01:34.840
bokutachi wa nani mo kawarazu ni

00:01:34.690 --> 00:01:38.740
kyou mo tonari ni iru

00:01:40.190 --> 00:01:44.190
In the same world

00:01:40.190 --> 00:01:44.190
onaji kono sekai ni ite

00:01:54.140 --> 00:01:59.580
The First Longsword

00:01:55.100 --> 00:01:59.580
The Samurai is Here !

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:20.280
Ukiha-Kamikaze style kenjutsu – first technique:

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:22.700
Hayate!

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:55.050
Ukiha-Kamikaze style kenjutsu – fifth technique:

00:02:55.730 --> 00:02:56.230
Nagi!

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:14.420
You still have a lot to work on, Yoichi!

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:17.670
Don't let your guard down, ever!

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:21.180
An immature swordsman like you won't be able to withstand my attack!

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:26.220
You're the one with your guard down, Father.

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:28.270
Well done.

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:32.190
Yoichi,

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:35.900
seventeen years have passed since I started raising you on this mountain.

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:40.240
I'm proud you have become strong, enduring all the hard training.

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:42.200
It's all thanks to you, Father.

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:46.330
However, you will not get any better than you are now.

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:48.080
Why's that?

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:50.790
I want to become stronger!

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:53.170
I still look to you for guidance!

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:59.880
You idiot! You're already too good!

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:02.510
You think I'd be able to avoid all those traps?

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:04.840
Imagine being the one who has to set them up!

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:07.930
You're becoming too skilled for your age!

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:10.850
I don't even feel qualified for my position now!

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:14.310
...How can I say something like that?

00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:16.360
Father.

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:19.360
Yoichi.

00:04:20.610 --> 00:04:23.910
You know nothing about the world outside this mountain.

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:29.870
You have to experience new things and meet people besides me and your mountain friends.

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:34.080
You must experience, not just store knowledge.

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:37.290
Experience will strengthen your mind!

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:39.750
Leave the mountain, Yoichi!

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:42.760
Polish not only your sword but your own soul as well!

00:04:42.760 --> 00:04:45.300
Become a truly strong samurai!

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:49.260
Yes, Father!

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:53.640
I, Karasuma Yoichi, promise that I'll become a great samurai!

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:12.120
The Ikaruga family, like us, passes down the Ukiha-Kamikaze style. They have a dojo in the city.

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:17.000
I'm sure they'll look after you.

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:21.670
Kagome, where are Ayame and Chihaya?

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:24.220
They're still in bed.

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:25.930
Ah, they're hopeless.

00:05:25.930 --> 00:05:30.100
Everyone should be at the table for a family meal.

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:35.350
Well, it's a holiday, and we have nothing to do anyway.

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:38.730
Why don't we let them stay in bed for a little longer?

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:43.650
Who could it be so early in the morning?

00:05:43.650 --> 00:05:45.700
I'll go and check.

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:54.370
What's wrong, Kagome?

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:03.670
It's from Uncle Karasuma-sama.

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:07.970
Get Ayame and Chihaya, Kagome!

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:12.850
And that someone is coming to our house?

00:06:12.850 --> 00:06:13.810
Yup.

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:16.520
And we're going to live with him from today on?

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:17.480
Yup.

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:20.520
Are you nuts?

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:23.570
Why do we have to listen to this old guy we've never met before?

00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:26.030
The Ikarugas and the Karasumas share a common ancestor,

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:27.490
and we've known each other for a long time.

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:30.280
We've never met him before, but he's someone we can trust.

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:33.740
How can we trust a guy who sends us a letter by arrow?

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:36.450
Even kids send e-mail with their cell phones these days!

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:38.620
How are they different?

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:40.920
Hell no!

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:43.590
Hey, Chihaya, you say something too!

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:45.960
Actually, I'm completely fine with it.

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:49.840
We could use a man in case of an emergency.

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:53.850
What if he's the one causing the emergency?

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:57.480
You should know there isn't really a man who can beat Ibuki.

00:06:57.480 --> 00:07:00.190
Besides, I think it's going to be a great plot for my manga.

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:01.440
Do whatever you want!

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:02.980
Where do you think you're going, Ayame?

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:05.400
I'm going back to sleep.

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:09.240
You haven't finished your breakfast yet. You have to eat every bit of it!

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:12.030
Isn't that what you should do for the person who made it for you?

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:18.540
For Kagome.

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:20.410
For Kagome?

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:23.580
I thought I should help out because it's a holiday.

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:33.430
Don't cook such delicious-looking dishes for breakfast. You're going to make me fat.

00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:37.560
And they actually are delicious. Do you want to make me get fat so badly?

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:41.230
So this is the city!

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:43.350
What an amazing view!

00:07:43.630 --> 00:07:45.480
What's up with him? Is he a samurai?

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:46.940
Are they filming something?

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:48.280
A cosplay?

00:07:48.280 --> 00:07:49.940
He has a wooden sword.

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:51.320
It's scaring me.

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:55.490
But now is not the time to be amazed.

00:07:55.850 --> 00:07:58.080
It's already two o'clock. They should be waiting at—

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:08.840
Wassan! He's a samurai! This is killing me! Are you filming a movie or something?

00:08:08.840 --> 00:08:11.630
Or do you belong to Akihabara? A time traveler perhaps?

00:08:11.630 --> 00:08:13.590
Shut up, Torigaya!

00:08:14.550 --> 00:08:16.600
Watch where you're going.

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:19.100
Asshole.

00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:24.440
Why aren't you saying anything?

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:26.310
You scared?

00:08:26.310 --> 00:08:29.320
Don't tell me that thing on your waist is an imitation?

00:08:32.780 --> 00:08:36.780
You bumped into me on purpose, didn't you?

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:42.660
And what's more, you insulted my sword which is the same as the samurai's life.

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:45.460
Striking a scabbard is a slap in the face to a samurai!

00:08:45.460 --> 00:08:47.000
It's the same as asking for a duel!

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:50.550
Huh? What age do you think you live in?

00:08:52.470 --> 00:08:54.130
My god! Wassan!

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:56.970
Just a big talker.

00:08:58.850 --> 00:09:03.100
Hey, you're not allowed to swing something like that here.

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:05.390
Get a hold of yourself, Wassan!

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:07.350
Isn't he Washizu from Yoku-High?

00:09:07.350 --> 00:09:09.610
No way. I heard he was strong.

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:11.320
But he got beaten in one hit.

00:09:11.320 --> 00:09:13.610
What do you think you're
looking at? This isn't a show!

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:17.110
The sword didn't hit me.

00:09:18.070 --> 00:09:20.120
He stopped it right before it hit me.

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:22.620
I can't believe he did that with the air blast.

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:24.870
Wassan, you should really go see a doctor!

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:28.130
Get a computed tomographic scan! Get x-sected!

00:09:28.130 --> 00:09:29.630
Shut up, Torigaya!

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:33.130
Who the hell is he?

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:35.930
My name is Karasuma Yoichi!

00:09:35.930 --> 00:09:40.600
I'm a samurai who came down to the city to learn about the world and discipline my mind at the same time!

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:43.520
Oh, our assault suspect is a fine young man.

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:45.480
Oh, how kind of you.

00:09:47.310 --> 00:09:49.650
It's delicious!

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:51.940
He sure is a nice young man.

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:56.610
I admit you're a nice young man, but you can't walk around in such an outfit.

00:09:57.700 --> 00:09:59.200
Why's that?

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:00.280
You're asking me why?

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:03.620
Can't you see? It's because no one's walking around dressed like that.

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:07.670
So not acting like everyone else does is considered a crime?

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:14.880
Excuse me! I'm keeping someone waiting!

00:10:17.090 --> 00:10:18.180
Thank you for the tea!

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:21.470
Hey you!

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:24.560
Sorry!

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:28.440
Who is he?

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:32.060
I wonder.

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:48.870
I have to hurry. I'm going to be late.

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:52.460
And where was I meeting them?

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:55.590
He's not coming.

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:57.510
How strange.

00:10:58.420 --> 00:11:01.050
What does he look like in the first place?

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:02.890
How are we going to tell if it's him?

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:06.810
Umm... I'm sure he's someone who can use Ukiha-Kamikaze kenjutsu.

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:09.020
And how are we going to know that?

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:11.480
He's probably late because of something unavoidable.

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:13.940
I'm sure he'll meet us here as long as we wait.

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:15.820
I can't keep up with you.

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:18.320
Where are you going, Ayame?

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:22.070
I'm going to shop for clothes. If that guy comes, call me with the cell.

00:11:22.070 --> 00:11:25.160
Then I'll go check out the bookstore.

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:26.120
Chihaya!

00:11:26.620 --> 00:11:29.710
How selfish of them.

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:31.620
Kagome?

00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:35.000
Ibuki-oneechan.

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:36.550
I have to go pee.

00:11:37.550 --> 00:11:39.210
Do you think you can go there by yourself?

00:11:39.210 --> 00:11:41.630
Yes, I'll try.

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:47.140
I don't get it at all.

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:51.640
Could it be that I've come to a foreign country by some kind of a mistake?

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:56.480
Anyway, I have to go up. Maybe I could find them from a higher place.

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:15.210
Wassan! Look at him!

00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:38.650
O-Ouch.

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:53.210
Why am I grappling her?

00:12:53.560 --> 00:12:56.710
I-I'm sorry. I have reasons for this.

00:12:57.420 --> 00:12:59.340
Don't make too much noise!

00:13:02.400 --> 00:13:05.050
M-My bad. I just accidentally...

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:09.930
Sorry for having such small breasts that you would touch them by "accident"!

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:13.310
You molester! Hentai! Pervert!

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:18.480
A purse-snatcher!

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:20.610
Sorry.

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:24.320
What the hell is he?

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:36.580
You fool!

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:44.550
How dare you! I won't let you get away!

00:13:56.810 --> 00:13:57.810
You!

00:13:57.810 --> 00:13:58.270
Sorry.

00:14:00.940 --> 00:14:02.270
Wassan!

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:18.670
How cheap!

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:21.130
Pardon me.

00:14:31.640 --> 00:14:37.140
Father, the enemy in the city sets up even better traps than you do.

00:14:37.140 --> 00:14:39.900
They are tough to deal with.

00:14:40.600 --> 00:14:41.690
The sea?

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:44.690
Umm... Mister?

00:14:45.670 --> 00:14:48.110
I would really appreciate it if you let me go.

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:56.370
Do you have a taste for this type of thing?

00:14:57.620 --> 00:14:59.870
What's with this mess, sir?

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:03.590
I-I'm sorry. I was just...

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:07.760
Sir!

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:10.930
What's up with him?

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:13.100
Hold it right there!

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:17.520
Who do you think you are?

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:19.850
You don't even deserve to hear my name, villain!

00:15:19.850 --> 00:15:22.270
What you deserve is a blow of justice!

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:32.950
Ukiha-Kamikaze style kenjutsu – first technique:

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:34.410
Hayate!

00:15:44.710 --> 00:15:47.380
Who the hell is that molester?

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:58.600
I guess I've reached the end of my rope.

00:15:58.600 --> 00:16:01.810
The city sure is a scary place.

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:08.780
Mountain...

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:21.160
Maybe it's better for me to live on the mountain.

00:16:32.340 --> 00:16:34.510
What? Kagome hasn't come back?

00:16:34.510 --> 00:16:38.930
Yeah. I'll go look for her, so you wait here.

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:42.350
And Chihaya, have the department store make an announcement about a lost child.

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:44.060
Roger.

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:50.360
It's natural to get lost in a huge building like this. Don't blame yourself.

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:53.320
But I'm ten now.

00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:56.570
My sisters will laugh at me.

00:16:56.570 --> 00:16:58.080
That's not true.

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:03.540
There's no way they're going to laugh at their sister when she's scared.

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:08.130
I'm sure they'll give you a hug out of relief when you're back.

00:17:11.170 --> 00:17:13.630
I promise I'll take you to your sisters.

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:16.640
You'll get home together.

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:18.640
Yeah.

00:17:18.990 --> 00:17:21.470
So, what does she look like?

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:23.560
She's very kind.

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:26.900
And she's a very good cook too.

00:17:26.900 --> 00:17:30.570
Pardon me, but does she have anything I can tell by looking at her?

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:36.070
She has big boobs.

00:17:36.030 --> 00:17:38.530
Boobs, huh?

00:17:42.850 --> 00:17:43.700
That big?

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:45.660
No, much bigger than that.

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:46.960
Then how about her?

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:49.630
No, she's a little more mature?

00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:52.300
I guess it's hard to tell.

00:17:52.300 --> 00:17:54.590
There she is! That's my sister Ibuki!

00:17:54.590 --> 00:17:55.630
Really?

00:17:56.550 --> 00:17:59.140
I see...

00:17:59.640 --> 00:18:00.800
Freeze!

00:18:00.800 --> 00:18:02.850
Get away from her!

00:18:02.850 --> 00:18:04.270
I can't do that.

00:18:04.270 --> 00:18:07.810
I have to take her to her sister.

00:18:08.050 --> 00:18:11.270
We'll listen to what you have to say later! Come with us for now!

00:18:12.690 --> 00:18:15.740
Don't worry. Samurai keep their promises.

00:18:16.740 --> 00:18:18.660
Hey you!

00:18:22.530 --> 00:18:23.950
Hold on tight.

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:26.250
Who are you?

00:18:26.870 --> 00:18:28.540
A samurai.

00:18:36.510 --> 00:18:37.300
For real?

00:18:37.300 --> 00:18:39.300
Call to your sister!

00:18:39.800 --> 00:18:43.760
O-Onee-chan!

00:18:47.560 --> 00:18:51.020
Ukiha-Kamikaze style kenjutsu – fourth technique: Arashi!

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:18.800
We apologize for keeping you waiting.

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:21.300
The express train is departing.

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:33.980
The Ukiha-Kamikaze style of kenjutsu... could it be him?

00:19:50.910 --> 00:19:53.290
Oh, what have I done?

00:19:53.290 --> 00:19:55.960
I don't know how to apologize to them.

00:19:56.550 --> 00:20:00.760
Wherever the meeting place was, they won't be waiting for me by now.

00:20:00.760 --> 00:20:02.970
You're Karasuma Yoichi-san, right?

00:20:03.800 --> 00:20:06.300
T-That's right.

00:20:08.430 --> 00:20:14.600
I'm the acting Ukiha-Kamikaze kenjutsu instructor at the Ikaruga dojo, Ikaruga Ibuki!

00:20:14.980 --> 00:20:17.480
I've come to pick you up.

00:20:19.980 --> 00:20:23.950
Sorry, my sisters were with me until a while ago,

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:26.620
but I told them to go home since it's late.

00:20:26.620 --> 00:20:30.370
You've helped my sister Kagome, if I'm not mistaken.

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:32.870
So you're the girl from earlier.

00:20:32.850 --> 00:20:33.750
Yes?

00:20:35.280 --> 00:20:37.000
Now, time to pick up where we left off.

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:39.960
Yoichi-san. What's going on?

00:20:39.960 --> 00:20:44.050
We're swamped with complaints from everywhere concerning this boy's alleged rampage.

00:20:44.430 --> 00:20:47.800
Excuse me, but there's something I have to take care of before that.

00:20:49.470 --> 00:20:53.390
People do have words of appreciation for him, you know.

00:20:53.960 --> 00:20:56.400
Like catching a purse-snatcher.

00:20:56.810 --> 00:20:59.900
I guess he's not a bad person, is he?

00:21:00.940 --> 00:21:03.150
No, of course not.

00:21:04.650 --> 00:21:06.660
Was it really all right to let him go?

00:21:07.320 --> 00:21:10.080
It looked like he was sorry for what he's done.

00:21:10.080 --> 00:21:12.120
And the store clerks accepted his apologies.

00:21:12.120 --> 00:21:13.580
We're sorry for all the trouble.

00:21:13.580 --> 00:21:15.960
Thank you for the tea, once again.

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:21.960
Besides, finishing what he's served is a sign of a good person.

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:24.800
I'll tell you that.

00:21:27.300 --> 00:21:29.430
So this is the Ikaruga dojo.

00:21:29.430 --> 00:21:34.270
I'm sorry, but I'll show you around the dojo tomorrow since it's late.

00:21:35.180 --> 00:21:38.560
I love having the lights on when I come home.

00:21:39.560 --> 00:21:40.770
We're home.

00:21:40.770 --> 00:21:42.820
I brought Yoichi-san with me.

00:21:43.230 --> 00:21:44.900
Damn, what took you so long?

00:21:44.900 --> 00:21:47.070
We're hungry.

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:50.280
It's nice to meet all of you,

00:21:50.280 --> 00:21:51.620
my name is...

00:21:51.930 --> 00:21:53.910
Ah! The molester from earlier!

00:21:53.910 --> 00:21:56.120
Ah! The guy into homosexual stuff.

00:21:56.120 --> 00:21:58.120
Y-You are...!

00:21:58.540 --> 00:22:00.340
Samurai-san.

00:22:03.340 --> 00:22:05.590
My name is Karasuma Yoichi!

00:22:06.220 --> 00:22:08.090
I'm looking forward to my stay!

00:22:20.690 --> 00:22:27.190
I regret not realizing

00:22:20.690 --> 00:22:27.190
taisetsuna hito datte wakarazu ni

00:22:28.140 --> 00:22:34.760
That you were the most important person to me

00:22:28.140 --> 00:22:34.760
sugoshiteta imamade ga kuyashiiyo

00:22:35.740 --> 00:22:42.320
I have to deliver these feelings to you myself

00:22:35.740 --> 00:22:42.320
jibun kara iwanakucha dame nanda

00:22:43.350 --> 00:22:51.780
Please, stay by my side forever

00:22:43.350 --> 00:22:51.780
itsumademo itsumademo koko ni ite kienaide

00:22:51.380 --> 00:22:56.010
The same feelings that were born through a dream

00:22:51.380 --> 00:22:56.010
yume unda onaji kimochi daitara

00:22:55.810 --> 00:22:59.770
Make me hesitate a little

00:22:55.810 --> 00:22:59.770
sukoshi mayoi kanji tetahazu

00:22:59.640 --> 00:23:06.760
When I open my heart and free myself from sadness

00:22:59.640 --> 00:23:06.840
kokoro hirake kanashimi toki hanatsu shunkan wa

00:23:06.640 --> 00:23:10.630
I will seize tomorrow with both of my hands

00:23:06.640 --> 00:23:10.630
ashita wo tsukamaeru ryoute

00:23:10.530 --> 00:23:14.480
I hope you will light up the dawn in my heart

00:23:10.530 --> 00:23:14.480
tomoshitai to negau yoake

00:23:14.520 --> 00:23:16.830
You're not alone

00:23:14.520 --> 00:23:16.830
hitori ja nai

00:23:16.630 --> 00:23:21.160
Because I love you

00:23:16.630 --> 00:23:21.160
masaka LOVE YOU

00:23:21.600 --> 00:23:25.770
I know you're afraid of change

00:23:21.600 --> 00:23:25.770
kawaruno ga kowai to kimi mo

00:23:25.610 --> 00:23:29.330
So I promise to stay by your side, smiling

00:23:25.610 --> 00:23:29.330
kitto soba ni hohoemu kara

00:23:29.190 --> 00:23:36.790
Let's change kindness into strength

00:23:29.190 --> 00:23:36.790
yasashisa de tsuyoku narouyo

00:23:40.060 --> 00:23:42.060
Next Episode!

00:23:42.060 --> 00:24:07.090
The Second Longsword

00:23:42.060 --> 00:24:07.090
Welcome to Yokkou

00:23:43.810 --> 00:23:44.820
School.

00:23:44.820 --> 00:23:47.050
That place is filled with the desire of knowledge and other emotions,

00:23:47.050 --> 00:23:51.410
where young blood and ambitions ferment and dance madly body-to-body!

00:23:51.410 --> 00:23:55.110
The students add their willpower, pride and curiosity to the soup.

00:23:55.110 --> 00:23:58.160
A samurai who wants to learn is also added in and a strong wind blows.

00:23:58.330 --> 00:24:01.040
Then it's brewed until the flavor of battle comes out.

00:24:01.330 --> 00:24:05.790
After a fight between two guys, a pinch of tsundere seasoning will be added.

00:24:05.790 --> 00:24:07.620
Yes, it's done.

00:24:07.090 --> 00:24:10.090
Don't miss the next episode!
